rge branch-A-CodingStandard","messageBody":"","tags":["A-CodingStandard"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"0fd4008828d242bcd635723526a5a7f828dd60f3","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch-Level-9","messageBody":"# Conflicts:\n#\tsrc/main/java/duke/parser/Parser.java\n#\tsrc/test/java/duke/parser/ParserTest.java\n","tags":["Level-9"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-09-04T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"734f8a18a3c696dfb9750cc6b4f586d1bc85a05e","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add JavaFX GUI while preserving command-line behavior","messageBody":"","tags":["Level-10"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"gradle":{"insertions":23,"deletions":1},"fxml":{"insertions":25,"deletions":0},"java":{"insertions":282,"deletions":81},"md":{"insertions":26,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"93bede040406bc40c1e9afb56b86bee73159b770","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch-Level-10","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-09-08T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"324b05ae50b2f0902bddd339a4bc9f00312db28d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add assertions for internal invariants","messageBody":"Task creation and command processing rely on non-null task data,\nvalid indexes, supported command types, and correctly used parser\nhelpers.\n\nViolating these assumptions indicates a programming error that should\nbe detected early during development.\n\nAdd Java assertions to document and verify these invariants. Enable\nassertions for all Gradle application run tasks so the checks are\nperformed during development.\n\nKeep DukeException for invalid user commands and storage errors because\nthose conditions can occur during normal use.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"gradle":{"insertions":3,"deletions":0},"java":{"insertions":23,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"d6594c74ce868a9c07507add65279e50161fd31e","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #1 from geengene/branch-A-Assertions","messageBody":"A-Assertions: Add assertions for internal invariants","tags":["A-Assertions"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"651a14ba66cf268d1566975ff41220f17ecff0bc","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Encapsulate task state","messageBody":"Task fields have more visibility and mutability than their callers\nneed. Descriptions and dates never change after construction, and\nsubclasses do not access the base task fields.\n\nRestrict the base fields to private and mark immutable task data as\nfinal. This makes each field lifecycle explicit and prevents accidental\ncoupling through subclass access.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":5,"deletions":5}}},{"hash":"4c3a2ab435c8a77ec320f891b627f302053a683a","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Protect task list contents","messageBody":"TaskList accepts and returns mutable ArrayList references. Callers can\nchange its contents without using TaskList operations, bypassing class\ninvariants and coupling Storage to one list implementation.\n\nAccept the List interface and copy constructor input. Return an\nimmutable snapshot for persistence so TaskList retains sole ownership\nof its mutable collection.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":38,"deletions":8}}},{"hash":"64297a8219c272966610edff87e6269b5aa96295","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Centralize task persistence","messageBody":"Every task-changing command repeats the same storage call. This mixes\npersistence details into command handling and gives future storage\nchanges several places to update.\n\nExtract a saveTaskList helper and use it after each task mutation. The\ncommand handlers now stay at one level of abstraction, while task\npersistence has a single maintenance point.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":11,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"25947859da9750d2be0d0a8f9379a0b5f63d7a23","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Use streams to find matching tasks","messageBody":"TaskList.find manually builds its result with a loop. Finding tasks is\na direct filtering operation, so the collection bookkeeping obscures\nthe method intent.\n\nReplace the loop with a stream filter and collect matching tasks into\nthe ArrayList required by TaskList. This expresses the selection\ndirectly while preserving task order and matching behavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":4,"deletions":6}}},{"hash":"a49bb6faf521b9baa99ada4a881e846c50073337","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #2 from geengene/branch-A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"A-CodeQuality: Improve code quality","tags":["A-CodeQuality"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"5da8a9fd2232e40bccecdb2a8c02d96f6fb6c5bc","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge master into branch-A-Streams","messageBody":"Master now includes the CodeQuality increment, while the Streams branch\nis based on the earlier Assertions merge. Leaving the branch behind\nwould keep its pull request out of sync with the latest master.\n\nMerge master and resolve TaskList by retaining the List abstraction\nwhile collecting filtered stream results with toList. This preserves\nboth increments in a tested combined state.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"cfbaebc16b12fc9910b48eaf7ad66895bc2b601b","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #3 from geengene/branch-A-Streams","messageBody":"A-Streams: Use streams for task filtering","tags":["A-Streams"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-09-09T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"914bbd6b4771c0ffd70f1800104bdcf62fd4950c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add schedule view for dated tasks","messageBody":"Users need a focused view of deadlines and events on a given day.\nAdd a schedule command that filters deadlines by due date and events\nby their inclusive date range while preserving insertion order and\ncompletion status.\n\nKeep the operation read-only and leave todos and the storage format\nunchanged. Document the command and cover matching, empty,\nboundary-date, completed-task, and invalid-date cases.\n","tags":["A-FullCommitMessage"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":162,"deletions":3},"md":{"insertions":87,"deletions":22}}},{"hash":"ba592e09e53fb3476fea4c02e1a29eac1b22fe78","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #4 from geengene/branch-B-ViewSchedules","messageBody":"Add schedule view for dated tasks","tags":["BCD-Extension"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}]},"authorFileTypeContributionMap":{"geengene":{"java":1788,"md":531,"fxml":25,"sh":0,"bat":0,"gradle":26,"txt":0}},"authorContributionVariance":{"geengene":112616.4},"authorDisplayNameMap":{"geengene":"CS2103T-T16-3 KUAH..QHEE"}}
